  "definition": "Required Information",
  "effectiveDate": "2017-06-07",
  "historyNote": "#1993, eff 3-31-82; ss by #2706, eff 5-10-84; ss by #4093, eff 7-21-86; EXPIRED 7-21-92 New. #5441, eff 7-27-92; ss by #6658, eff 1-1-98, EXPIRED: 1-1-06 New. #12201-B, eff 6-7-17",
